+# A 線 R0 實際生圖提示詞
+
+工具：內建 GPT Image；每次呼叫只生成一張，依序執行。
+參考：已逐張檢視 staging/ref/ 全部 8 張；參考圖僅取構圖、光影與風格。
+
+## 01_forest.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept. Generate exactly ONE landscape PNG, 16:9, 1536x864 or larger (prefer 2048x1152). Forest concept for a Han-era Chinese educational third-person game. UE5-quality stylized chibi 3D rendering, rounded appealing geometry, lush saturated warm greens, soft shadows, strong diagonal golden sunlight shafts and tiny suspended dust. Match the camera/composition of the viewed ref_32 and ref_38: slightly elevated close third-person rear camera, winding broad earthen trail centered into the depth, tall trees framing both sides, readable playable space, thick grassy borders. Tiantai mountain forest containing recognizable pines, broadleaf paper mulberry trees, hanging vines and ferns. One small Liu Chen stands at lower center facing away, 2.5-head-tall Han herbal gatherer, beige cloth headscarf, brown narrow-sleeved rough tunic, straw sandals, woven gathering basket on back, small utility axe tucked at belt. Forest dominates frame. Reference images are style/composition guidance only; replace their original hero completely. No red hat hero, sword, shield, elephant, text, letters, watermark, HUD, UI, editor chrome. Natural bright magical forest, polished real-time game aesthetic rather than painterly illustration.
+```
+
+## 02_gorge.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept. Generate exactly ONE landscape 16:9 PNG, at least 1536x864, preferably 2048x1152. Tiantai mountain gorge in Han-era China, environment concept for a stylized chibi 3D exploration game, UE5-quality rounded detailed geometry, saturated warm greens, soft shadows, dramatic diagonal golden sunbeams with floating dust. Wide third-person game-height establishing composition from the bottom of a very deep ravine looking toward an immense sheer cliff. At the TOP of the central steep cliff stands ONE large old peach tree, its canopy clearly visible against the sky and heavy with abundant ripe pink-gold peaches. Thick woody climbing vines and kudzu hang continuously from beside the peach tree down the rock face almost to the reachable base, visibly explaining the climbing route. A clear shallow freshwater stream winds across the bottom foreground, transparent water over rounded stones, ferns and moss around edges, pines on distant slopes. Strong visual separation: peach tree high above, climbable vines across the vertical rock face, clear stream below. No people, no buildings, no bridge, no combat, no sword, shield, elephant or red hat hero. No text, watermark, HUD, UI, panels or editor chrome. Appealing sculpted game world, not photorealism or a painting.
+```
+
+## 03_village.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept. Exactly ONE landscape PNG 16:9, at least 1536x864, preferably 2048x1152. Magical immortal village beside a stream in ancient Han-era China. UE5-quality stylized chibi game environment, appealing chunky rounded architecture and lush saturated warm green plants, soft shadows, dreamy warm golden diagonal sun shafts and floating illuminated particles. Camera is a slightly elevated third-person village entrance establishing view, inspired by ref_8 and ref_14 spatial layout only: open traversable foreground dirt plaza, compact houses framing both sides and the center distance. NOT European half timber buildings. Low ancient Chinese timber and plaster houses with gently pitched roofs made of reflective verdigris COPPER TILES, visible turquoise-green metal tiles individually edged in gold catching sunlight. Deep crimson translucent silk gauze drapes hang across open verandas and doorways; small bronze bells visibly hang from each curtain corner. Pink flowering peach trees around the houses. A narrow clear stream runs from bottom right toward center, crossed by a small weathered low wooden footbridge at the village entry. Establish this fixed layout for later matching return view: large low house left foreground, main house centered in middle distance, small house right beside stream, peach tree left of main house, bridge lower right. Peaceful dreamlike warm gold lighting, abundant plants, readable playable paths. No characters, no modern objects, no red hat hero, no sword, shield or elephant. No text, logos, watermark, HUD, UI, signs with writing, border or editor chrome. Polished stylized 3D render, not a painting.
+```
+
+## 04_return.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept / image edit lighting-weather and architecture replacement. Create exactly ONE 16:9 landscape PNG at least 1536x864. Use the supplied immortal village image as the exact composition reference. Depict the SAME village entry centuries later, '邑屋改異': preserve camera, overall ground layout and locations of left foreground house, center middle-distance house, right small house, stream and low footbridge in lower right, and large tree left of center house. Replace all glamorous structures with unfamiliar dilapidated modest HAN-era commoner dwellings: simple straight low pitched grey clay-tile roofs with broken patches, rough timber frames, cracked earthen plaster, aging doors, sagging eaves. Remove verdigris copper and gold roofs, all crimson silk drapes, hanging bells, luxurious ornaments and distant fantasy pavilions. All peach trees are now bare dead trees with gnarled branches, no flowers, sparse dry grasses and weeds, muddy worn village path, weathered bridge in the same place, still water. Cold desaturated slate grey and muted blue palette, overcast dusk, heavy pale grey sky, diffuse soft shadows, melancholy unfamiliar abandoned feeling, no magical shafts or glitter. Preserve appealing UE5-quality stylized rounded 3D game aesthetic, not photorealism. No people, no ghosts, no invented narrative action. No text, writing, logos, watermark, UI or HUD. No red hat hero, swords, shields, elephant.
+```
+
+## 05_liuchen.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept. ONE landscape 16:9 PNG at least 1536x864. Single character asset reference for Dzine image-to-3D: Liu Chen, ancient Han Chinese male herbal gatherer, friendly young adult face, stylized chibi 3D game character exactly about 2.5 heads tall, large round head, stocky compact torso, short limbs. ONE SINGLE FULL BODY front view only, neutral A-pose: both straight arms angled down 35 degrees away from torso, hands clearly separated from clothing with open relaxed fingers, both feet separated. Entire head, hands, shoes and equipment fully inside frame with generous margins. Center figure occupying about 80 percent image height; horizontal image with plain empty sides. Pure uniform LIGHT GREY BACKGROUND, no environment, no floor line, no gradient, neutral even studio lighting with minimal contact shadow. Beige linen cloth headscarf tied around a small topknot, simple brown rough-spun cross-collar SHORT NARROW-SLEEVED tunic with tight rolled cuffs above elbow, rope belt, taupe knee-length trousers, woven straw sandals; traditional woven gathering basket worn on his back visible around shoulder edges, small ordinary utility axe TUCKED at belt on right hip, never held. Keep arms unobstructed. Soft rounded UE5-quality stylized 3D, readable materials, restrained fabric weave, warm approachable face. Not armor, not martial hero. No sword, shield, red hat, elephant, extra characters, extra views, props on ground, text, labels, logos, watermark, UI, decorative border. A single clean isolated modeling reference.
+```
+
+## 05b_liuchen_turn.png
+
+```text
+Use case: stylized-concept. Make ONE landscape 16:9 PNG at least 1536x864: orthographic character turnaround sheet of the EXACT Liu Chen shown in supplied reference. THREE full-body views in one image, left to right FRONT, exact SIDE profile facing right, BACK. No text labels or dividing lines. All views at same scale, head and soles perfectly aligned, generous empty margins above topknot and below straw sandals, no clipping or overlaps. Preserve reference face, beige knotted cloth headscarf and topknot, brown cross-collar narrow short-sleeved rough tunic, rope belt, taupe knee trousers, straw sandals, woven basket and shoulder ropes, small utility axe tucked on character's SAME anatomical hip consistently across views. Cute 2.5-head-tall compact Han herbal gatherer, soft rounded high-quality stylized 3D game render. Neutral A-pose arms angled down away from torso, relaxed hands, separated feet. Back view clearly exposes basket design, side view shows basket depth. Pure LIGHT GREY background, even neutral studio lighting, minimal shadow. No scenery, floor line, extra props, extra figures beyond the three views, red hat, swords, shields, elephant, writing, watermark, UI, logos. This is a model reference sheet, preserve identity and outfit rather than redesign.
+```
+
+

