+Use case: stylized-concept. ONE landscape 16:9 PNG at least 1536x864. Single isolated character asset reference for Dzine image-to-3D. Ruan Zhao, Han-era Chinese male herbal gatherer, friendly young adult, cute stylized chibi UE5-quality 3D character about 2.5 to 2.7 heads tall but noticeably TALLER and SLIMMER than a stocky Liu Chen: narrower oval face, slender torso and limbs, gentle reserved expression, large eyes. ONE full-body FRONT view only in neutral A-pose, straight arms angled downward away from torso with clearly separated hands, feet apart, no cropping; generous margin above hat, below sandals and around bamboo staff. Wears broad woven straw conical DOULI hat, dark navy-blue rough-spun cross-collar short NARROW-SLEEVED tunic, simple rope belt, charcoal knee trousers, straw sandals, small woven gathering basket on back. One hand holds ONE long slender BAMBOO WALKING STAFF upright beside body, staff separated from silhouette and wholly visible, no combat stance. Distinct blue clothing and straw hat, no cloth headscarf, no axe. Pure uniform LIGHT GREY background without scenery, gradients or floor line, neutral even studio illumination with minimal contact shadow. Large rounded head with modestly longer slim body, appealing sculpted game style and tactile simple fabric. No other figures, extra views, loose props, sword, shield, red hat, elephant, text, labels, watermark, UI or border. Single subject centered on wide canvas.
